{"unit_id":"tag:04JN:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme），设<MATH_0002>为几何点（geometric point），位于<MATH_0003>上。按定义，这意味着<MATH_0004>代数闭（algebraically closed）。特别地，绝对Galois群（absolute Galois group），对应于<MATH_0005>，平凡（trivial）。因此由定理<REF_0001>，层（sheaves）的范畴（category），定义于<MATH_0006>上，等价（equivalent）于集合（sets）的范畴（category）。等价（equivalence）由取截面（sections）给出，在<MATH_0007>上取截面。这终于提供了茎（stalk）函子（functor）的另一个定义。即，函子（functor）<MATH_0008>同构（isomorphic）于函子（functor）<MATH_0009>。为严格证明，可使用引理<REF_0002>的(3)，取<MATH_0010>。此外，由此，引理<REF_0003>的(3)的一般情形由拉回（pullbacks）的函子性（functoriality）得出。\n","allowed_english":["Galois"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点"},{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭"},{"source_term":"absolute Galois group","target_term":"绝对Galois群"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"stalk","target_term":"茎"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"pullbacks","target_term":"拉回"},{"source_term":"functoriality","target_term":"函子性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"geometric point","target_term":"几何点","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"algebraically closed","target_term":"代数闭","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"absolute Galois group","target_term":"绝对Galois群","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"trivial","target_term":"平凡","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"